.SS Abstract
\f[CR]PEB_LOADER\f[R] provides lightweight routines for locating loaded
modules and exported functions without relying on the Windows loader
APIs.
Instead of calling functions such as \f[CR]GetModuleHandleW()\f[R] or
\f[CR]GetProcAddress()\f[R], the module walks the Process Environment
Block (PEB) and parses PE export tables manually.
.PP
This is useful for low\-level runtime environments, shellcode, custom
loaders, dependency\-free applications, and situations where direct
interaction with the Windows API is undesirable.
.PP
